message: "If you use Venison in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Venison: DEER waveform analysis"
abstract: >-
  Analysis of double electron-electron resonance (DEER) data: background
  correction and validation, Tikhonov regularization, and Monte Carlo error
  analysis of sum-of-Gaussians distance distribution models, with a desktop
  app for the full workflow.
type: software
